  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.repositories.mock.MockOrderRepository\": {\n        \"summary\": \"In-memory implementation of OrderRepository interface for testing purposes. Stores orders in an ArrayList without persistence to any database. Key methods include: hasOrder() and getOrder() for order lookup by ID; getOrdersByStatus() and getOrdersByDealerName() for filtered order retrieval; getOrderByQuoteId() to find orders associated with specific quotes; createOrder() which creates a new order from a quote ID (validates quote existence and prevents duplicate orders from the same quote, generating order IDs in format 'order-{quoteId}'); two updateOrder() overloads for full order replacement or status/event updates; and removeOrder() which is a stub returning false (not implemented). Implements TestPath interface providing reset() to clear all orders and reset the counter. Uses a QuoteRepository dependency to validate quotes during order creation. Throws BadRequestException for invalid quotes or non-existent orders, and ConflictingRequestException when attempting to create duplicate orders from the same quote.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/mock/MockOrderRepository.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
